window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Some secrets should stay buried.</b></p> <p>After accidentally freeing a demon, ticking off the werewolf alpha, and possibly inciting a war, Darby Adler’s Warden job is in serious peril. </p> <p>With the council up in arms and a literal god on her doorstep, Darby needs to figure her life out, and pronto.</p> <p><b>If she can’t, losing her job might be the least of her problems.</b></p>"; 
